        <obo:IAO_0000111 xml:lang="en">investigation</obo:IAO_0000111>
        <obo:IAO_0000112>Lung cancer investigation using expression profiling, a stem cell transplant investigation, biobanking is not an investigation, though it may be part of an investigation</obo:IAO_0000112>
        <obo:IAO_0000114 rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000122"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">a planned process that consists of parts: planning, study design execution, documentation and which produce conclusion(s).</obo:IAO_0000115>
